o></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your performance is tracked across sessions, allowing your past performance to affect future tasks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321790/extras/ecbf0a54e856ceee99c77b053b0f02db.poster.avif?t=1753126286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321790/extras/ecbf0a54e856ceee99c77b053b0f02db.webm?t=1753126286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321790/extras/ecbf0a54e856ceee99c77b053b0f02db.mp4?t=1753126286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animation and Voiceover - Tasks are fully animated and voiced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321790/extras/cb6f1285e8d2c145ec8646cf4996b168.poster.avif?t=1753126286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321790/extras/cb6f1285e8d2c145ec8646cf4996b168.webm?t=1753126286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321790/extras/cb6f1285e8d2c145ec8646cf4996b168.mp4?t=1753126286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable/Disable categories of tasks based on your personal preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block tasks that you never want to see again.</p></li></ul>",
